{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sweet and adorable brick-breaking game in collaboration with <strong>Sugar Conflict</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Ultimate Sugar Crush!</strong>, each character is the personification of a carefully crafted sweet. As you break the blocks, their charming appearances will gradually be revealed, accompanying you on a delightful and refreshing journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter if you're looking for casual fun or chasing trophies, Ultimate Sugar Crush! delivers a unique brick-breaking experience with dazzling skills and random elements, ensuring every playthrough feels fresh and exciting!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956790/extras/b70bd4eee472c69b66e5ef61dd0aad50.avif?t=1759730690\" width=1560 height=1635 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956790/extras/7444659965c4e8ce8e12e8bef3c2b8d7.avif?t=1759730690\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956790/extras_big/7444659965c4e8ce8e12e8bef3c2b8d7.webp?t=1759730690 width=1560 height=1437 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956790/extras/f5f0b7bcce2f10af71a8d827d648f543.avif?t=1759730690\" width=1560 height=1542 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956790/extras/d7af479c68d9201d5d075463ec03125c.avif?t=1759730690\" width=1560 height=1577 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956790/extras/fb5ebe063ab8fc60637515179b9afbbf.avif?t=1759730690\" width=1299 height=1762 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956790/extras/cd03c915d076913613d6dbc0568f8935.avif?t=1759730690\" width=1560 height=1544 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adorable Dessert Girls</strong>: Cr\u00eape, Muffin, Pudding, Cream Puff, and Marshmallow Parfait come to life as cute anthropomorphic girls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satisfying Brick-Breaking Action</strong>: Smash blocks, combos, and thrill of chain reactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun &amp; Unique Skills</strong>: Bombs, paddles, and other special abilities empower the style and strategy to the gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized Challenges</strong>: Block positions change each time you enter a stage, giving you a new experience with every play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sweet visual treat</strong>: Adorable Japanese-inspired art style that makes every moment both exciting and heartwarming.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Patissier Level 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3956790/cb4723de677fa06d92f7ea70ed3a33bfebd76401.jpg"},{"name":"Veteran Patissier Level 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3956790/eec82c3cff7dfc12551a99ef9ae71d06989ee0d8.jpg"},{"name":"Perfect Patissier Level 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3956790/64c2ffe2fd480e98d4e25220da2d7cc6f7962698.jpg"},{"name":"Patissier Level 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3956790/53ede3ae42c5852a861b5c02e6e788ccac3cb84e.jpg"},{"name":"Veteran Patissier Level 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3956790/66c21f523ef849e775e08876a56fbcc103728c90.jpg"},{"name":"Perfect Patissier Level 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.st